      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Data from 24-h ECG monitoring of 137 patients with angina of effort or painless IHD were compared with respective X-ray evidence of heart enlargement. The patients were identified at an epidemiological screening for multifactorial IHD prevention among male residents of Kaunas, aged 40-59 yrs. A correlation was established between the enlargement of the cardiac volume and left compartments and the severity of arrhythmias."},
